# apps/promo-worker — bindings reference (Brief 153).
#
# splash-promo is the runtime for the promotions feature. At Brief 153
# the only live route is `GET /promo/api/ping`; subsequent briefs add
# CRUD, materials, and announcement endpoints. The bindings list below
# is the day-one minimum that lets the worker boot and read/write the
# 9 promo tables (`promotions`, `promo_*`) + the `splash-promo-files`
# R2 bucket.
#
# Non-secret vars live in `wrangler.toml [vars]`. Secrets are bound via
# `pnpm --filter @splash/promo-worker exec wrangler secret put NAME`
# (CLAUDE.md constraint #4 — set secrets via CLI, not the dashboard UI).
#
# =============================================================================
# Non-secret vars (set in wrangler.toml [vars])
# =============================================================================
#
# SUPABASE_URL
#   Same Supabase project URL as the rest of the monorepo.
#   Current value: https://rewokyofschtvqgxrxwl.supabase.co
#
# =============================================================================
# Secrets (bound via `wrangler secret put`)
# =============================================================================
#
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY
#   Required. Service-key (NOT the legacy `_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` name — see
#   CLAUDE.md constraint #3). The worker reads/writes the `promotions` +
#   `promo_*` tables and the `auth_unified` view via PostgREST using this
#   key. Same value already bound on splash-damage / splash-forms /
#   splash-sysadmin / splash-workorders / splash-jotform.
#
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#   Required. Used by `@splash/auth authenticate()` on the
#   /auth/v1/user round-trip when a request carries an `sb-access-token`
#   cookie. Internal-tooling only — every promo endpoint will be
#   cookie-gated, no public-customer surface today. Same value already
#   bound on splash-damage / splash-forms / splash-sysadmin /
#   splash-workorders / splash-jotform.
#
# =============================================================================
# R2 bucket binding (set in wrangler.toml [[r2_buckets]])
# =============================================================================
#
# PROMO_FILES → splash-promo-files
#   Bucket created by operator (Public Access Disabled, Standard
#   storage). Namespace at Brief 153: `promo-materials/{promo_id}/
#   {material_id}.{ext}` — matches the comment on `promo_materials.r2_key`
#   in supabase/promo-tables.sql. Single-bucket, single-prefix today;
#   room for siblings later (e.g. `promo-announcement-attachments/`).
#
# =============================================================================
# Deferred to future briefs
# =============================================================================
#
# No webhook secrets at Brief 153 — announcement send webhook,
# internal-note notification, and any future PA integrations are deferred
# to their own briefs. No scheduled triggers; no cron slot reserved yet.
